| Test 6: a big SoundFont (FluidR3Mono, 24 MB file, about 285 MB in
| memory, 400 MB while loading). Needs SoundFonts.FluidR3Mono in this
| folder: it comes in MIDISynthTests-SF3.zip. Loading may take a while.
Obey <Obey$Dir>.Setup
Echo ==== 6 Big SF3: <Sys$Date> <Sys$Time> ==== { >> <MSTest$Out> }
Set MSTest$SF 0
IfThere <MSTest$Dir>.SoundFonts.FluidR3Mono Then Set MSTest$SF 1
If "<MSTest$SF>" = "0" Then Error 0 SoundFonts.FluidR3Mono is missing: unzip MIDISynthTests-SF3.zip over this folder first.
Unset MSTest$SF
Echo Test 6: loading FluidR3Mono and rendering 30 s of tttheme2...
Run <MSTest$Dir>.midiplay -t -s 30 -o <MSTest$Out> <MSTest$Dir>.Songs.tttheme2 <MSTest$Dir>.SoundFonts.FluidR3Mono
Obey <MSTest$Dir>.LoadSound
Echo Test 6: playing 20 s with FluidR3Mono (it loads again first)...
Run <MSTest$Dir>.midiplay -s 20 -o <MSTest$Out> <MSTest$Dir>.Songs.tttheme2 <MSTest$Dir>.SoundFonts.FluidR3Mono
Echo Test 6 done.
